{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Confinio: Reality Prison",
    "steam_appid": 3030830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/4247abc43736e195f38a3931013237f9.avif?t=1739439743\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <strong>Confinio: Reality Prison</strong>, a 2D graphic novel where darkness shrouds your past and uncertainty guides your steps. Wake up in a cell with no memory where your decisions will mark your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/f5ac829c3b14b510324a373e73a422b1.avif?t=1739439743\" width=700 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You've just woken up, you're confused,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You look around without knowing where you are. It looks like a cell, are you trapped? You don't remember anything that happened. How did you get there? What's going on? Too many unanswered questions. <strong>Are there more people here? Would you trust them? Would you let them help you?</strong> So many decisions to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/246f31b79839808754dca5f16710cdca.avif?t=1739439743\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to gradually discover the reality, even if it is not what you expected. Make cautious decisions, as these will be the ones that will build your path in prison. Try to remember who you are and stay strong, for at any moment madness can take hold of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/f5ac829c3b14b510324a373e73a422b1.avif?t=1739439743\" width=700 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become Dromaius, the protagonist with no memories.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through the prison in confusion, making choices that will create your reality, but be careful not to let that reality lead to your death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/5daac393bd7af7e58841c59aff34d97c.avif?t=1739439743\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the other inmates, interact with them and discover their stories. Every interaction, every object, every decision will bring you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your dexterity with mini-games that you must overcome to escape. But don't expect the answer to these to be the obvious one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/f5ac829c3b14b510324a373e73a422b1.avif?t=1739439743\" width=700 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A psychological mystery that will keep you on edge until the very end.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the challenge of facing your own ego and decipher the enigma of your existence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you and your decisions will decide your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/DEAD.jpg?t=1739439743\" width=700 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game knows you</strong> \u2013 Face dilemmas that will test your identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Routes according to your personality</strong> \u2013 Your way of acting will determine the path you will follow. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your worst enemy is yourself</strong> \u2013 Face your fears, doubts and hidden secrets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles to escape</strong> \u2013 Use logic and intuition to unlock new paths. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the 7 endings</strong> \u2013 Multiple outcomes await depending on your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/f5ac829c3b14b510324a373e73a422b1.avif?t=1739439743\" width=700 height=70 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Are you ready to discover\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0the truth\u00a0behind Confinio: Reality Prison?</strong>   </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/4247abc43736e195f38a3931013237f9.avif?t=1739439743\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter <strong>Confinio: Reality Prison</strong>, a 2D graphic novel where darkness shrouds your past and uncertainty guides your steps. Wake up in a cell with no memory where your decisions will mark your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/f5ac829c3b14b510324a373e73a422b1.avif?t=1739439743\" width=700 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You've just woken up, you're confused,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You look around without knowing where you are. It looks like a cell, are you trapped? You don't remember anything that happened. How did you get there? What's going on? Too many unanswered questions. <strong>Are there more people here? Would you trust them? Would you let them help you?</strong> So many decisions to make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/246f31b79839808754dca5f16710cdca.avif?t=1739439743\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to gradually discover the reality, even if it is not what you expected. Make cautious decisions, as these will be the ones that will build your path in prison. Try to remember who you are and stay strong, for at any moment madness can take hold of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/f5ac829c3b14b510324a373e73a422b1.avif?t=1739439743\" width=700 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become Dromaius, the protagonist with no memories.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through the prison in confusion, making choices that will create your reality, but be careful not to let that reality lead to your death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/5daac393bd7af7e58841c59aff34d97c.avif?t=1739439743\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the other inmates, interact with them and discover their stories. Every interaction, every object, every decision will bring you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your dexterity with mini-games that you must overcome to escape. But don't expect the answer to these to be the obvious one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/f5ac829c3b14b510324a373e73a422b1.avif?t=1739439743\" width=700 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A psychological mystery that will keep you on edge until the very end.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the challenge of facing your own ego and decipher the enigma of your existence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you and your decisions will decide your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/DEAD.jpg?t=1739439743\" width=700 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game knows you</strong> \u2013 Face dilemmas that will test your identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Routes according to your personality</strong> \u2013 Your way of acting will determine the path you will follow. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your worst enemy is yourself</strong> \u2013 Face your fears, doubts and hidden secrets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles to escape</strong> \u2013 Use logic and intuition to unlock new paths. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the 7 endings</strong> \u2013 Multiple outcomes await depending on your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030830/extras/f5ac829c3b14b510324a373e73a422b1.avif?t=1739439743\" width=700 height=70 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Are you ready to discover\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0the truth\u00a0behind Confinio: Reality Prison?</strong>   </p>",
